      sourceId: 'tatoeba-cc-by-2.0-fr',
      englishText: 'Crafting a perfect Mojito can be a challenge. Achieving the right balance of sweetness, mintiness, and lime is an art.',
      chineseText: '調製一杯完美的 Mojito 並非易事。要達到甜味、薄荷味和青檸味之間的完美平衡，是一門藝術。',
